{"id":"2aaca686968cfbdbb3e3365ffbe9e4ce5a90c875","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1259001","title":"上班总忍不住打开交易软件看持仓盈亏","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"SorcererXW","excerpt":"投资 - @SorcererXW - 最近发现干活的时候，总是隔一会儿就想打开交易软件看一眼。其实也不是想交易，就是单纯想知道现在赚了多少、亏了多少，如果上了杠杆那就更焦虑了。而且一旦打开交易软件，就忍不住顺手看看行情，回","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/SorcererXW\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/249b/cee8/116648_xlarge.png?m=1695792071\" width=\"73\" alt=\"SorcererXW\" data-uid=\"116648\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    <h2>上班总忍不住打开交易软件看持仓盈亏</h2>\n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/SorcererXW\">SorcererXW</a> · <span title=\"2026-11-23 09:16:25 +08:00\">18h 44m ago</span> · 2820 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>最近发现干活的时候，总是隔一会儿就想打开交易软件看一眼。</p>\n<p>其实也不是想交易，就是单纯想知道现在赚了多少、亏了多少，如果上了杠杆那就更焦虑了。</p>\n<p>而且一旦打开交易软件，就忍不住顺手看看行情，回过神来十分钟就过去了。</p>\n<p>不知道大家有没有类似的情况？你们平时都是怎么解决的？</p>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n<div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/交易\"><li></li> 交易</a><a href=\"/tag/焦虑\"><li></li> 焦虑</a><a href=\"/tag/成瘾\"><li></li> 成瘾</a></P><p><span>24 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-11-23 18:45:15 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18316871\" data-reply-id=\"18316871\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/54fd/2720/444393_normal.png?m=1703741821\" alt=\"nzynzynzy\" data-uid=\"444393\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>3</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>新手期就会这样，时间长了就脱敏了。当时炒 BTC 巴不得一直开着看，后来发现这个玩意你看和不看一个吊样子，老看就说明自己不是价值投资而是赌徒心态。真价值投资就按年计算了，不在乎这一眼两眼</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18317052\" data-reply-id=\"18317052\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ad6f3085ea45499fdf3960859c2265e1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"focux\" data-uid=\"96012\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>4</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>说明你亏得还不够多，多了就不敢打开看了 ：）</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18317095\" data-reply-id=\"18317095\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d3203a0d2df4bdc5381a2e4e62c510ff?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"IlIl\" data-uid=\"504788\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>5</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>我还特地做了个同花顺账本同步到浏览器查看的插件...越看越亏</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18317366\" data-reply-id=\"18317366\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/93ada8600bdbb7e17a0a1e8d9e8f3f1d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ropz\" data-uid=\"543237\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>8</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>我公司是证券公司，我负责开发行情，可惜我不炒股。。。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18317398\" data-reply-id=\"18317398\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b0a5b8d68a3562ef1b358de5bc892a24?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ldx78203199\" data-uid=\"452051\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>9</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/IlIl\">IlIl</a> 我还特地做了个同花顺账本同步到浏览器查看的插件...越看越亏 这是最傻的的全天心态给吊着 涨跌起伏，心里阈值疯狂被破坏</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18317897\" data-reply-id=\"18317897\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1b0e/4571/133254_normal.png?m=1761809559\" alt=\"benson458\" data-uid=\"133254\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>10</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>新手期就这样的，都是这样过来的，看着账户里的钱波动，慌得一批，总想着去操作，投入了大量时间在上面，钱也没赚着。<br>现在都是按月去看了，操作频率少得可怜，虽然今年还是亏，但是心态好了好多。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18318056\" data-reply-id=\"18318056\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2b4c67a94d42b99a10fe710bf7e51e00?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ljn95869\" data-uid=\"661844\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>11</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>我怕乱操作，直接旧苹果手机设置屏幕使用时间，密码别人随机设的，停用时间 8-16 点，全靠条件单买卖</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18318059\" data-reply-id=\"18318059\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2b4c67a94d42b99a10fe710bf7e51e00?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ljn95869\" data-uid=\"661844\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>12</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>交易软件登录用指纹，不用密码，密码自己也不知道</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18318934\" data-reply-id=\"18318934\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a5af21f8dc33efc660faf5fb6b18aff?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"clacf\" data-uid=\"411532\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>14</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>all in qqq，30 年后再看</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18319208\" data-reply-id=\"18319208\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/916f085f0933df3ebd69fcf955f56222?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"imicksoft\" data-uid=\"378857\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>16</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>新手期，亏多了就不想打开了</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18319212\" data-reply-id=\"18319212\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f201/ee6f/552552_normal.png?m=1774919223\" alt=\"NoobNoob030\" data-uid=\"552552\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>17</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>账户的变动会产生兴奋，波动越大越兴奋，会产生多巴胺，让人行为成瘾，是赌徒一天不赌浑身难受的原因。</p><p>但是长期反复刺激会脱敏，兴奋感下降，谨慎追寻更大的刺激（加仓上杠杆）</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18319253\" data-reply-id=\"18319253\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/916f085f0933df3ebd69fcf955f56222?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"imicksoft\" data-uid=\"378857\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>19</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>把支付宝微信银行 app 的资产金额录入到 excel 里，每天做记录，算出总金额，再插入图表，生成总资产曲线，盯着总资产曲线，上升就拿好标的，变弯向下，就考虑减仓，看看那个标的要高位减仓/压力位减仓 x 破线减仓，要卖出止损。<br>也可以把亏损金额和可用现金也录入生成图表，亏损金额过大了也要控制风险。<br>谁开发一个这种程序，或者已经有了，请叫我一下。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18319693\" data-reply-id=\"18319693\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2124c8aba1b20643d71a5101a519a80d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zerovoid\" data-uid=\"263784\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>21</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>正常，世界上最刺激的游戏，天天和国家各路金融大鹅对线 PK，很难不沉迷其中。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18319728\" data-reply-id=\"18319728\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dbd3/6c22/210254_normal.png?m=1715407255\" alt=\"8355\" data-uid=\"210254\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>22</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>没有价值 10 点之前看一看,14:40 之后看看就行了.中间都是噪音.<br>正常只有这 2 个窗口期.</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18319732\" data-reply-id=\"18319732\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/aea488b5566c4ef8fc574e316fb04ef2?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Knuth\" data-uid=\"488565\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/Knuth\">Knuth</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-23 18:26:07 +08:00\">9h 34m ago via iPhone</span></p></div>\n            <p><span>23</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>已经很久没看股票账户了🥲倒是最近每天都会看看黄金</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"上班总忍不住打开交易软件看持仓盈亏 SorcererXW · 18h 44m ago · 2820 views 最近发现干活的时候，总是隔一会儿就想打开交易软件看一眼。 其实也不是想交易，就是单纯想知道现在赚了多少、亏了多少，如果上了杠杆那就更焦虑了。 而且一旦打开交易软件，就忍不住顺手看看行情，回过神来十分钟就过去了。 不知道大家有没有类似的情况？你们平时都是怎么解决的？ 交易 焦虑 成瘾24 replies • 2026-11-23 18:45:15 +08:00 3 新手期就会这样，时间长了就脱敏了。当时炒 BTC 巴不得一直开着看，后来发现这个玩意你看和不看一个吊样子，老看就说明自己不是价值投资而是赌徒心态。真价值投资就按年计算了，不在乎这一眼两眼 4 说明你亏得还不够多，多了就不敢打开看了 ：） 5 我还特地做了